Date: Fri, 11 Sep 2026 05:10:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] cxxopts: include cstdint for uint8_t cxxopts.hpp uses
 uint8_t directly but does not include <cstdint>. Recent GCC/libstdc++
 versions no longer make the type available through the headers included
 indirectly.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [EA specific]
---
 extern/include/dxrt/extern/cxxopts.hpp | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/extern/include/dxrt/extern/cxxopts.hpp b/extern/include/dxrt/extern/cxxopts.hpp
index aef2846..aa7c215 100644
--- a/extern/include/dxrt/extern/cxxopts.hpp
+++ b/extern/include/dxrt/extern/cxxopts.hpp
@@ -41,6 +41,7 @@ THE SOFTWARE.
 #include <vector>
 #include <algorithm>
 #include <locale>
+#include <cstdint>

 #ifdef CXXOPTS_NO_EXCEPTIONS
 #include <iostream>
